# Steps to build

1. Setup a schema structure needed for the application inside /lib/db dir using drizzle.
2. Guide me to setup the supabase for this.
3. Setup the Better-Auth for authentication and connect the db with it via adapter. And use inbuild components for login, signup etc forms.
4. Create a Service layer where all the actions and serices needed will be written.
5. Now create routes and components needed for the for the application

